# Context

## Background
Manual snapshot of the autonomous looper run (session
run-c0c3b8b94e3cf4c1), taken at the game director's request.
The batch holds about 30 backlog tasks completed over 22 hours:
three cities, quests, bosses, brewing minigames, touch controls,
tutorial, SleepyDex, endings, and audio scaffolding.

## Why This Way
Looper lands work in milestone batches. The director asked to
commit and push ahead of the next milestone to get a testable
build. make check passed before the commit: 899 test cases,
0 failures, 75/75 suites.

